  early-stage founders will be demoing what they’re working on from small
  tables.&#13\;\n&#13\;\nYou’ll be able to:&#13\;\n&#13\;\n- See what loc
 al startups are building&#13\;\n&#13\;\n- Talk directly with founders an
 d teams&#13\;\n&#13\;\n- Meet others in the tech community&#13\;\n&#13\;
 \n- Move freely between demos and conversations at your own pace&#13\;\n
 &#13\;\nTo help make those moments easier\, we’re featuring Wyrl\, a net
 working app built for in-person events. Wyrl shows you who’s around you 
 in real time\, lets you view their profiles\, and message other attendee
 s so you can connect while you’re attending this and other Startup Week 
 events.&#13\;\n&#13\;\nFree drink tickets are available with Wyrl sign u
 p. Download it at wyrl.io/app&#13\;\n&#13\;\nHosted by Wyrl&#13\;\n&#13\
 ;\nSponsored by TiE Oregon Foundation\n\nImported from: http://calagator
 .org/events/1250482553
